{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123045","id":4404600316,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBojd_A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123045","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123045.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123045.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123045","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123045/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123045/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123045/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2ef026493e6afd4633dc24aa90d09fae7dee3b9b","number":123045,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix script state not updating in the editor when global classes change","user":{"login":"shiva-kar","id":106133762,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlN5Ag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106133762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar","html_url":"https://github.com/shiva-kar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiva-kar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #102222\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nWhen a script uses a `class_name` that doesn't exist yet, creating the missing class doesn't cause the script to be checked again. The script can remain in an invalid state, and its exported properties won't appear in the Inspector until the editor is restarted or the script is changed and saved again.\r\n\r\nThe same problem can leave open script tabs showing stale errors after the missing class has been created.\r\n\r\nThis PR listens for `EditorFileSystem`'s `script_classes_updated` signal. When the set of global classes changes, the loaded scripts are reloaded so they can re-evaluate their dependencies. Open script tabs are also validated so their error state is updated.\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d88faa7-9636-4fc3-acc0-4ca6cc989538\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb6b4f06-04bf-43bf-8dce-beca8a213ea4\r\n\r\nWith this change, creating a missing global class updates the affected scripts without requiring an editor restart.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.c